   6:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          functionalities of the CORTEX:
   8:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions 
  10:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *
  11:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   @verbatim  
  12:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  13:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  14:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  16:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  17:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Interrupts using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  18:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===========================================================
  19:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]     
  20:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  21:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     The Cortex-M4 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  22:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  23:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping()
  24:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         function according to the following table.
  25:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(). 
  26:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Enable the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  27:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) please refer to programming manual for details in how to configure priority. 
  28:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****       
  29:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- When the NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0 is selected, IRQ preemption is no more possible. 
  30:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****          The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the sub priority.
  31:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  32:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  33:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest preemption priority
  34:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest sub priority
  35:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  36:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****  
  37:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  38:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Systick using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  39:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ========================================================
  40:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  41:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     Setup SysTick Timer for time base.
  42:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****            
  43:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) The HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function calls the SysTick_Config() function which
  44:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        is a CMSIS function that:
  45:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Reload register with value passed as function parameter.
  46:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick IRQ priority to the lowest value 0x0F.
  47:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Resets the SysTick Counter register.
  48:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Counter clock source to be Core Clock Source (HCLK).
  49:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Enables the SysTick Interrupt.
  50:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Starts the SysTick Counter.
  51:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****     
  52:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick Clock source to be HCLK_Div8 by calling the macro
  53:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG(SYSTICK_CLKSOURCE_HCLK_DIV8) just after the
  54:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function call. The __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG() macro is defined
  55:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        inside the stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.h file.
  56:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  57:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by calling the
  58:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(SysTick_IRQn,...) function just after the HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  59:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        call. The HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() call the NVIC_SetPriority() function which is a CMSIS funct
  60:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  61:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) To adjust the SysTick time base, use the following formula:
  62:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****                             
  63:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
  64:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value is the parameter to be passed for HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  65:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value should not exceed 0xFFFFFF
  66:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  67:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   @endverbatim
  68:../hal/chipwhisperer-fw-extra/pinata/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
